[SECTION]
TITLE: What this gym taught

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
ROO deep rebuild gym for WhiteSpace / ROOGuildApp (VALHALLA).
SoT branch/commit: Develop@a8a1edd713d6db6db61d42ed4eacf6a9e8737d07.
SSOT Gate is the only publisher; sibling bots propose only.

V-model shape used:
  USR → REQ → FNC/API → CMP/INT → UNT
                     ↘ TST (plans) → EVD (proof; Last Boss only)

Learnings:
1. Develop live behavior is SoT; Staging tip may be newer chronologically but is not SoT unless promoted.
2. published ≠ proven. Registry acceptance of TST plans is not left–right proof.
3. Edge authorship matters: Test Master authors verifies (plan lineage); depends_on is design-only; evidences is Last Boss only; requires_tol is node field only.
4. Open musts stay open — deferred ≠ waived (Auth 008/015/017; Tenant live Discord 026/029/030).
5. Tooling must be pinned before execution claims (Vitest/MSW/Playwright/coverage still greenfield).
<<<

