[SECTION]
TITLE: How to navigate StrictDoc package

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Open DELIVERABLES.md first (human index).
Then:
- requirements/usr.sdoc — user desires
- requirements/req.sdoc — system REQs with Parent → USR
- design/summary.sdoc — tip counts + domain ID ranges
- verification/tests.sdoc — TST plans + honesty + open musts
- tools/tol.sdoc — present vs greenfield tools
- deep_learn.sdoc — this overview
Use strictdoc.toml to render HTML if StrictDoc CLI is available.
